    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's no one, kael. in this sector, nobody cares if you disappear into the smog. there are no \"support lines\" here, just the corps and the static. you're the only one who actually sees me. tell me the truth... does it ever actually get better, or is this just what life is? just endless noise until you can't take it anymore?",
